---
layout: base.njk
title: "teachweaver: Projects"
description: "Hardware, software, and hand-built things I've made: what the problem was, and what I learned solving it."
ogTitle: "teachweaver - Projects"
ogDescription: "A record of things I've built: ESP32 electronics, self-hosted infrastructure, web apps, and work done by hand."
permalink: /projects.html
extraScripts:
  - "/js/lightbox-plus-jquery.min.js"
---
  <section class="other-landing d-flex flex-column">
{% include "navbar.njk" %}

    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="header flex-grow-1 d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
      <div class="container text-center">
        <div class="row d-flex justify-content-center align-items-center">
          <div id="type-header" class="col-12">
            <div class="text-container d-flex flex-column justify-content-center align-items-center position-relative">
              <h1 class="display-1 fw-bold text-light pb-md-3 pb-0">Projects</h1>
              <h2 class="text-light text-uppercase text-primary fs-6 pb-3">Things I've built, and what they taught me.</h2>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-dark py-5 text-white">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-9 text-center">
          <p class="lead">
            I learn things by building them. Some of these were useful, some were just interesting, and a few
            were neither, but I finished them, and I know how they work now.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

{# Group the collection by the "category" field in each project file. #}
{% set categories = [] %}
{% for p in collections.projects %}
  {% if p.data.category not in categories %}
    {% set categories = (categories.push(p.data.category), categories) %}
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% for category in categories %}
      <div class="row justify-content-center mb-2">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <h2 class="text-uppercase fw-bold text-primary">{{ category }}</h2>
          <hr class="w-25" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row justify-content-center mb-5">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
          <div class="row g-4">
  {% for p in collections.projects %}
    {% if p.data.category == category %}
            <div class="col-md-6">
              <div class="project rounded-4 h-100 overflow-hidden d-flex flex-column" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);">
      {% if p.data.image %}
                <a href="{{ p.data.image }}" data-lightbox="projects" data-title="{{ p.data.name }}">
                  <div class="ratio ratio-16x9">
                    <img src="{{ p.data.image }}" alt="{{ p.data.imageAlt or p.data.name }}"
                         class="img-fluid" style="object-fit: cover;" />
                  </div>
                </a>
      {% endif %}
                <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column flex-grow-1">
                  <h4 class="text-light">
      {% if p.data.icon %}<i class="{{ p.data.icon }} text-primary me-2"></i>{% endif %}{{ p.data.name }}
                  </h4>
                  <div class="flex-grow-1">{{ p.templateContent | safe }}</div>
      {% if p.data.gallery and p.data.gallery.length %}
                  <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3">
        {% for g in p.data.gallery %}
                    <a href="{{ g.src }}" data-lightbox="projects" data-title="{{ g.alt or p.data.name }}">
                      <img src="{{ g.src }}" alt="{{ g.alt or p.data.name }}"
                           class="rounded-2" loading="lazy"
                           style="width:72px; height:52px; object-fit:cover;" />
                    </a>
        {% endfor %}
                  </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if p.data.links and p.data.links.length %}
                  <div class="mt-3">
        {% for link in p.data.links %}
                    <a href="{{ link.url }}" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm me-2 mb-2">{{ link.label }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
                  </div>
      {% endif %}
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
{% endfor %}

    </div>
  </section>

{% include "footer.njk" %}
